$ V truss of two CBARs with I1 = I2 = 0 on pinned supports with a load at the apex.
$ The members carry axial force only and must have exactly zero bending moment and bending stress.
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = 101_bar_zero_i1_i2_truss
ECHO = NONE
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
SPCFORCES = ALL
STRESS = ALL
ELFORCE = ALL
BEGIN BULK
PARAM,POST,-1
MAT1,1,2.E+11,,0.3,0.,0.,0.0
PBAR,1,1,0.0001,0.0,0.0,1.406E-09,,,+P1
+P1,0.005,0.005,-0.005,0.005,-0.005,-0.005,0.005,-0.005
GRID,1,,-1.0,0.0,0.0
GRID,2,,0.0,1.0,0.0
GRID,3,,1.0,0.0,0.0
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.0,0.0,1.0
CBAR,2,1,2,3,0.0,0.0,1.0
SPC1,1,123456,1,3
FORCE,1,2,,1.0,0.0,-1000.0,0.0
ENDDATA
